      <h2 id="principles-title">How we build apps</h2>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li><strong>Private by default.</strong> If an app doesn't need your data, it doesn't take it. Most of ours never send anything off your device.</li>
        <li><strong>Native to every Apple device.</strong> Built with Apple's own frameworks, so each app feels at home on iPhone, iPad and Mac.</li>
        <li><strong>One job, done well.</strong> Small, focused apps you can understand at a glance.</li>
        <li><strong>No ads, no tracking.</strong> Not in our apps, and not on this website.</li>
      </ul>
