    <div class="prose">
      <h2>What we make</h2>
      <p>Our apps cover the everyday: what's coming up today, the birthdays that matter, the places you've been, the scores for your teams. We also share some of the tools we build for our own work, like <a href="/apps/obfuscate/">obfuscate</a> and <a href="/apps/clarity/">Clarity</a>. <a href="/apps/">See all apps and tools</a>.</p>

      <h2>Consulting</h2>
      <p>We use AI coding agents every day to build our own software, and we help other businesses do the same: analysing how your team works, setting agents up properly, and training your people to get real value from them. We work on-site in Sydney and remotely anywhere. <a href="/consulting/">Learn about consulting</a>.</p>

